#: ../../site/publication.md:1
msgid "Publication and platform status"
msgstr "发布与平台状态"

#: ../../site/publication.md:3
msgid ""
"This page records the deployment state; it is not a substitute for checking "
"a live site."
msgstr "本页记录部署状态，不能替代对线上站点的检查。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:6
msgid "GitHub Pages — live"
msgstr "GitHub Pages——已上线"

#: ../../site/publication.md:8
msgid "Verified on 2026-10-26 against `cloudQuant/fincore_cpp`:"
msgstr "2026-10-26 针对 `cloudQuant/fincore_cpp` 的验证结果："

#: ../../site/publication.md:10
msgid ""
"Pages is enabled with `\"build_type\": \"workflow\"`. A branch source "
"(`legacy`) breaks `deploy-pages`, so the source must stay \"GitHub "
"Actions\"; re-read `GET /repos/.../pages` after any UI change."
msgstr ""
"Pages 已启用，源类型为 `\"build_type\": \"workflow\"`。分支源（`legacy`）会让 `deploy-pages`"
" 失败，因此源必须保持为“GitHub Actions”；任何界面改动之后都要重新读取 `GET /repos/.../pages`。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:13
msgid ""
"The `github-pages` environment carries `custom_branch_policies: true` and "
"allows `master` only. A deploy job on any other branch finishes **failed "
"with zero steps and a 404 log**, which is the policy rejecting it rather "
"than a build problem. The allow-list is UI-only with the token used here."
msgstr ""
"`github-pages` 环境带有 `custom_branch_policies: true`，只允许 "
"`master`。在其他分支上，部署任务会**以零步骤失败、日志为 404** "
"收场，这是策略拒绝了它，而不是构建出了问题。本处使用的令牌只能通过界面维护白名单。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:17
msgid ""
"`docs` workflow run "
"[`40286395187`](https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp/actions/runs/40286395187)"
" was the first with `build`, `pages` and `deploy` all green; later runs on "
"`master` repeated it. Publication therefore happens by merging into "
"`master`."
msgstr ""
"`docs` 工作流运行 "
"[`40286395187`](https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp/actions/runs/40286395187)"
" 是第一次 `build`、`pages`、`deploy` 三步全绿；之后在 `master` 上的运行重复了这一结果。因此发布通过合并到 "
"`master` 完成。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:22
msgid "Live URLs, each returning 200 on 2026-10-26:"
msgstr "线上地址（2026-10-26 均返回 200）："

#: ../../site/publication.md:24
msgid "Landing: `/fincore_cpp/`"
msgstr "落地页：`/fincore_cpp/`"

#: ../../site/publication.md:25
msgid "English: `/fincore_cpp/en/latest/`"
msgstr "英文：`/fincore_cpp/en/latest/`"

#: ../../site/publication.md:26
msgid "Chinese: `/fincore_cpp/zh-cn/latest/`"
msgstr "中文：`/fincore_cpp/zh-cn/latest/`"

#: ../../site/publication.md:27
msgid ""
"Deep pages checked in both languages: `installation.html`, "
"`guides/metrics.html`, `api/metrics.html`, plus `conventions.html` in "
"Chinese"
msgstr ""
"两种语言都核对过的深页：`installation.html`、`guides/metrics.html`、`api/metrics.html`，中文侧另加"
" `conventions.html`"

#: ../../site/publication.md:29
msgid "Static asset: `/fincore_cpp/en/latest/_static/css/theme.css`"
msgstr "静态资源：`/fincore_cpp/en/latest/_static/css/theme.css`"

#: ../../site/publication.md:31
msgid ""
"The language directories are `en/latest/` and `zh-cn/latest/` — probing "
"`en/` or `zh_CN/` returns 404 and says nothing about the deployment. A Pages"
" build keeps the version in the path segment (`latest`) and has no Read the "
"Docs style version switcher."
msgstr ""
"语言目录是 `en/latest/` 与 `zh-cn/latest/`——访问 `en/` 或 `zh_CN/` 会返回 "
"404，但这不能说明部署有问题。Pages 构建把版本放在路径段（`latest`）里，没有 Read the Docs 那样的版本切换器。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:36
msgid "Read the Docs — platform-pending"
msgstr "Read the Docs——平台发布待完成"

#: ../../site/publication.md:38
msgid ""
"The versioned [`.readthedocs.yaml`](../../.readthedocs.yaml) is ready. Two "
"linked RTD projects do not exist yet, and creating them needs the owner's "
"RTD account (the API answers 401 from this environment). Steps, once an "
"account is available:"
msgstr ""
"带版本号的 [`.readthedocs.yaml`](../../.readthedocs.yaml) 已就绪。两个关联的 RTD "
"项目尚未创建，创建它们需要仓库所有者的 RTD 账号（在本环境中相关 API 返回 401）。拿到账号后按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../site/publication.md:42
msgid ""
"Sign in at readthedocs.org with the account that can see "
"`cloudQuant/fincore_cpp`."
msgstr "用能看到 `cloudQuant/fincore_cpp` 的账号登录 readthedocs.org。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:44
msgid ""
"Add project `fincore_cpp-en`: repository URL "
"`https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp`, default branch `master`, "
"language **English**, configuration file `.readthedocs.yaml` (the file pins "
"Ubuntu 24.04, Python 3.13, Doxygen and the Sphinx requirements)."
msgstr ""
"新建项目 `fincore_cpp-en`：仓库地址 `https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp`，默认分支 "
"`master`，语言 **English**，配置文件 `.readthedocs.yaml`（该文件固定了 Ubuntu 24.04、Python "
"3.13、Doxygen 与 Sphinx 依赖）。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:48
msgid ""
"Add project `fincore_cpp-zh-cn`: same repository and branch, language "
"**Chinese**, and set the translation relationship so it builds against the "
"`zh_CN` catalog."
msgstr "新建项目 `fincore_cpp-zh-cn`：相同的仓库与分支，语言 **Chinese**，并设置翻译关系，使其基于 `zh_CN` 目录构建。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:51
msgid ""
"Trigger one build per project and check home, installation, one deep API "
"page, language switch, version label and static assets on the generated URL."
msgstr "两个项目各触发一次构建，并在生成的地址上核对首页、安装页、一个 API 深页、语言切换、版本标签与静态资源。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:54
msgid "Until those two builds answer 200, RTD is **platform-pending**, not PASS."
msgstr "在这两个构建返回 200 之前，RTD 属于**平台发布待完成**，不能算通过。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:56
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"

#: ../../site/publication.md:58
msgid ""
"A local HTML build is \"deployable artifact\"; a platform build without a "
"live page check is \"online check pending\"; neither is a publication PASS. "
"If one language or platform fails, the previously verified site must remain "
"available and the failed combination must be recorded."
msgstr ""
"本地 HTML 构建属于“可部署产物”；平台构建但未检查线上页面属于“线上检查待完成”；二者都不是发布 "
"PASS。如果某个语言或平台失败，先前验证过的站点必须保持可用，并记录失败的组合。"

